The other is that one of the running commands will guarantee not to
engage a monster. Here it is straight from the Nethack GuideBook:

" m[yuhjklbn]
               Prefix:  move without picking up objects or  fighting  (even
               if you remember a monster there)

  M[yuhjklbn]
               Prefix:  move far, no pickup. "

So use the M prefix and it'll take you far without engaging.


