Prayers for HP are always answered in emergency conditions. 
So you have to plan for that prayer. Your current HP must be below 6
to get the HP bump. So you have to carefully (so you don't die!) allow
for a monster to whack you. Make sure that it's safe to pray before starting
because an angry god, no HP, and a monster standing next to you whacking you
is pretty much YASD.

The HP bump works if you are less than 15 max HP at XL1 or 20 max HP at XL2.
But if you do the bump, then go to XL2, most characters are above 20 max HP.

